064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-4768.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efa56541ba84ae91eb0da267c473426b115491e2/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-4768.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2012-4768.js","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2012-4768_3.yaml","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2012-4768-2205.yaml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/422db14aea6c90ec23ceb3c50e97ae16c76d143d/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-47xx/CVE-2012-4768.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2012.tsv","https://github.com/rxerium/CISA-KEV/blob/c2a438961cf6a6c47831738d9c79cfc3110107fc/data/lists/NucleiList.txt","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-reserve/blob/c1581dbabe569bc0543baa46ed25f8fdd1555b2b/nvd/2012/CVE-2012-4768.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2012/CVE-2012-4768.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0020.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0264","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0264.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-3544","title":"Apache Tomcat 分块传输编码拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Apache Tomcat 在处理分块传输编码（chunked transfer encoding）时，其输入过滤器对 chunk extensions 的校验存在缺陷，导致攻击者无需身份认证即可通过构造畸形的 CRLF（回车换行）序列触发高资源消耗。该漏洞影响 Apache Tomcat 6.x 早于 6.0.37 版本及 7.x 早于 7.0.30 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。攻击者通过向目标 Tomcat 服务器发送包含畸形分块扩展的恶意数据流，即可耗尽服务器资源，造成拒绝服务，使合法用户无法正常访问服务。建议升级至 Tomcat 6.0.37 或 7.0.30 及以上版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2012-3544"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2013-06-01T14:21:05Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:43:26Z","remediation":"将 Apache Tomcat 6.x 升级至 6.0.37 或更高版本，将 Apache Tomcat 7.x 升级至 7.0.30 或更高版本。如暂无法立即升级，可在前置反向代理（如 Apache httpd 或 Nginx）中配置规则，拒绝或限制包含恶意块扩展（chunk extension）的 chunked 编码请求，或在 Tomcat Connector 配置中禁用 chunked transfer encoding 以临时缓解拒绝服务风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2013-05/0042.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2014/Dec/23","http://svn.apache.org/viewvc/tomcat/tc6.0.x/trunk/java/org/apache/coyote/http11/filters/ChunkedInputFilter.java?r1=1476592&r2=1476591&pathrev=1476592","http://svn.apache.org/viewvc?view=revision&revision=1378702","http://svn.apache.org/viewvc?view=revision&revision=1378921","http://svn.apache.org/viewvc?view=revision&revision=1476592","http://tomcat.apache.org/security-6.html","http://tomcat.apache.org/security-7.html","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/cpujan2014-1972949.html","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/cpujul2014-1972956.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/534161/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/59797","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/64758","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1841-1","http://www.vmware.com/security/advisories/VMSA-2014-0012.html","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/37220405a377c0182d2afdbc36461c4783b2930fbeae3a17f1333113%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/39ae1f0bd5867c15755a6f959b271ade1aea04ccdc3b2e639dcd903b%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/b84ad1258a89de5c9c853c7f2d3ad77e5b8b2930be9e132d5cef6b95%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/b8a1bf18155b552dcf9a928ba808cbadad84c236d85eab3033662cfb%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r03c597a64de790ba42c167efacfa23300c3d6c9fe589ab87fe02859c%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r587e50b86c1a96ee301f751d50294072d142fd6dc08a8987ae9f3a9b%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2012/CVE-2012-3544.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2013/CVE-2013-4322.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9e1d600240836820e3a1b1e4977c0af8cbdc05f2/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3544.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2012/CVE-2012-3544.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3544","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7ed81620937dbbe588ba076b06c9b1f7307f7b38/osv/cve/2012/UBUNTU-CVE-2012-3544.json","https://github.com/LyleMi/Learn-Web-Hacking/blob/7a42e3252fdcae87663434b1fd54ec89d671bfbe/source/language/java/container.rst","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97ee81b7fd22aa607f2e870c57709c6d893c5430/GHSA/data/2012/CVE-2012-3544.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-3544","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2012/CVE-2012-3544.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0264.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0262","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0262.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-3411","title":"Thekelleys Dnsmasq 接口验证缺陷导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Dnsmasq 2.63test1 之前版本在与特定 libvirt 配置配合使用时存在输入验证不当（CWE-20）导致的接口访问控制绕过漏洞，未能正确限制来自禁止网络接口的 DNS 查询请求。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送伪造的 DNS 查询包绕过接口访问控制，触发大量 DNS 响应流量放大，最终造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 dnsmasq 作为 DNS 转发器的虚拟化环境，攻击无需认证且复杂度低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2012-3411"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2013-03-05T21:38:54Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:43:10Z","remediation":"建议升级 Dnsmasq 至 2.63test1 或更高版本以修复该漏洞。若暂时无法升级，可在 libvirt 配置中禁用 dnsmasq 的接口监听功能，或在防火墙层面限制 DNS 服务仅允许可信网段访问，防止欺骗查询放大攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=683372","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2013-0276.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2013-0277.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2013-0579.html","http://thekelleys.org.uk/gitweb/?p=dnsmasq.git%3Ba=commitdiff%3Bh=2f38141f434e23292f84cefc33e8de76fb856147","http://thekelleys.org.uk/gitweb/?p=dnsmasq.git%3Ba=commitdiff%3Bh=54dd393f3938fc0c19088fbd319b95e37d81a2b0","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2013:072","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2012/07/12/5","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/54353","http://www.thekelleys.org.uk/dnsmasq/CHANGELOG","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=833033","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2012/CVE-2012-3411.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2012/CVE-2012-3411.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9e1d600240836820e3a1b1e4977c0af8cbdc05f2/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3411.json","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2012/CVE-2012-3411.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3411","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-3411.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-3411","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2012/CVE-2012-3411.md","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-3411","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/07f0931dd35f996dbf6b1a3296eaf61225fd7563/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-3411"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0262.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0027","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0027.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-6499","title":"WordPress Age Verification 插件开放重定向漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 Age Verification 插件 0.4 及更早版本中的 age-verification.php 文件存在开放重定向漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 redirect_to 参数传递恶意 URL，将用户重定向至任意外部网站，进而实施钓鱼攻击。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入的 URL 进行充分验证，影响使用该插件的所有 WordPress 站点。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-6499"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2013-01-12T04:33:49Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:48:14Z","remediation":"立即停用并删除 Age Verification 插件（该插件已停止维护，无安全更新可用）。如必需使用，可在 WordPress 根目录 wp-content/plugins/age-verification/age-verification.php 中为 redirect_to 参数添加白名单校验，仅允许本站域名内跳转。同时建议在 Web 应用防火墙（如 ModSecurity）中配置规则拦截 redirect_to 参数指向外部域名的请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/18350","http://www.osvdb.org/82584","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/51357","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/18350","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-6499.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-6499.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efa56541ba84ae91eb0da267c473426b115491e2/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-6499.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2012/6xxx/CVE-2012-6499.json","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/50629d052759f7d0d73f7da1b830ff6d52d10f93/nuclei-templates/2012/CVE-2012-6499-age_verification-91021b7f-06d1-4403-81bd-ba082685e58e.yaml","https://github.com/hack007x/veil_poc/blob/5cfe1da6e975ba816d728597885a5c5e79bda8bd/cves/2012/CVE-2012-6499.poc","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2012/CVE-2012-6499.rules","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-6499.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2012-6499-ea3a37c14cc61837e2b9307792de709a.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2012-6499.json","https://github.com/sailuh/perceive/blob/85ca622832e25fa91d8d836b8c93a096178bb35d/Notebooks/NVD/data/2012.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0027.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0209","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0209.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-4792","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer mshtml!CDwnBindInfo 释放后重用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 6至8版本中存在释放后重用漏洞，位于mshtml!CDwnBindInfo对象处理过程中。当浏览器未能正确管理已分配或已删除对象的生命周期时，远程攻击者可通过构造特制网页诱导用户访问，触发对已释放内存的访问，从而在目标系统上以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞在2012年12月已被野外利用，影响Windows全系平台，CVSS评分8.8，危害等级高。Microsoft已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-4792"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2012-12-30T18:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:45:43Z","remediation":"安装微软 2013 年 1 月安全更新 MS13-008 (KB2799329)，该补丁修复了 IE 6/7/8 中 CDwnBindInfo 对象的释放后重用问题。如无法立即打补丁，可配置 IE 安全区域为高等级并禁用 ActiveX 控件和活动脚本作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blog.fireeye.com/research/2012/12/council-foreign-relations-water-hole-attack-details.html","http://blogs.technet.com/b/srd/archive/2012/12/29/new-vulnerability-affecting-internet-explorer-8-users.aspx","http://blogs.technet.com/b/srd/archive/2012/12/31/microsoft-quot-fix-it-quot-available-for-internet-explorer-6-7-and-8.aspx","http://eromang.zataz.com/2012/12/29/attack-and-ie-0day-informations-used-against-council-on-foreign-relations/","http://labs.alienvault.com/labs/index.php/2012/just-another-water-hole-campaign-using-an-internet-explorer-0day/","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/119168/Microsoft-Internet-Explorer-CDwnBindInfo-Object-Use-After-Free.html","http://technet.mi