d":"2026-06-16T23:47:34Z","remediation":"升级 WordPress Integrator 模块至 1.33 或更高版本，该版本已修复 redirect_to 参数的输入过滤。如无法升级，在 wp-integrator.php 中对 redirect_to 参数添加 htmlspecialchars() 转义处理，或通过 .htaccess 规则拦截包含可疑脚本字符的 redirect_to 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/80628","http://packetstormsecurity.org/files/111249/WordPress-Integrator-1.32-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","http://www.darksecurity.de/advisories/2012/SSCHADV2012-010.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52739","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/74475","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37016","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-5913.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-5913.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efa56541ba84ae91eb0da267c473426b115491e2/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-5913.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2012-5913.js","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2012-5913-2222.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-5913.yaml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/422db14aea6c90ec23ceb3c50e97ae16c76d143d/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-59xx/CVE-2012-5913.json","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2012-5913_7.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2012-5913_5.yaml","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/data/diff_vs_acunetix.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder5/cve-2012-5913-2223.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0026.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0247","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0247.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-2619","title":"Broadcom BCM4325/BCM4329 Wi-Fi芯片802.11i信息元素输入验证漏洞","description":"Broadcom BCM4325 和 BCM4329 Wi-Fi 芯片在处理 RSN 802.11i 信息元素时存在越界读取漏洞，由于对输入验证不充分（CWE-20），远程攻击者可通过向目标设备发送特制的 802.11i 管理帧触发该漏洞，导致设备 Wi-Fi 功能崩溃或中断，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Acer、Apple、Asus、HTC、LG、Motorola、Nokia、Samsung、Sony 等多个品牌的移动设备，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。厂商已发布固件更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-2619"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-11-14T12:30:58Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:41:46Z","remediation":"升级 Apple iOS 至 6.1 或更高版本（适用于 iPhone 3GS、iPhone 4、iPod touch 第 4 代、iPad 2），该版本已修复 Broadcom BCM4325/BCM4329 Wi-Fi 芯片对 802.11i 信息元素的输入验证缺陷。如无法立即升级，可在 Wi-Fi 网络层面禁用 RSN IE 广播或使用 WPA2-AES 加密作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2013/Jan/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2013/Jan/msg00001.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5642","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5643","http://www.coresecurity.com/content/broadcom-input-validation-BCM4325-BCM4329","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/160027","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22739","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2012/CVE-2012-2619.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2012/2xxx/CVE-2012-2619.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2012/CVE-2012-2619.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2012/CVE-2012-2619.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-2619","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-2619.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2012/CVE-2012-2619.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-2619.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2012/CVE-2012-2619.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7ed8df0083f452d49c6e50d6c61a40c3f4b97ff9/2012/CVE-2012-2619.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0247.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0023","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0023.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-4940","title":"Axigen Mail Server 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Axigen Free Mail Server 的 View Log Files 组件存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 source/loggin/page_log_dwn_file.hsp 发送包含 ..（点点）序列的恶意 fileName 参数来下载任意文件，或通过向默认 URI 发送包含 .. 序列的 fileName 参数进行编辑或删除操作，从而实现任意文件读取或删除。该漏洞源于对用户输入的 fileName 参数缺乏充分的路径过滤，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，影响 Axigen Free Mail Server 相关版本，CVSS 评分 6.4，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2012-4940"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2012-10-31T19:55:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:45:56Z","remediation":"升级 Axigen Mail Server 至 7.2.0 及以上版本（该版本已修复日志文件组件中的路径遍历漏洞）。如无法升级，在 Web 管理控制台中将管理端口（默认 9000）绑定到内网 IP，并通过防火墙限制仅允许受信管理 IP 访问该端口，同时在 Web 服务器或反向代理层添加 URL 过滤规则，拦截包含 `..` 或 `..\\` 的 fileName 参数请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/586556","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/56343","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37996","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-4940.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-4940.md","https://github.com/