l.com/lists/oss-security/2012/10/26/1","http://openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2012/10/29/7","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/56280","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/79638","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-4547.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-4547.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efa56541ba84ae91eb0da267c473426b115491e2/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-4547.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2012-4547.js","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2012-4547_5.yaml","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2012-4547","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2012-4547_19.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Sep/03/Artifact/Report.csv","https://github.com/MaineK00n/vuln-data/blob/9e1ff46005584f5d4c094bd8d97e510415b9f767/gost/debian/9/CVE-2012-4547.json","https://github.com/pradeep11166/Auto-Recon2.0/blob/35c3d7b63c3d5e8848620c23f240925e8a4565a5/tools/nuclei/nuclei-templates/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-4547.yaml","https://github.com/0neOfU4/dddd/blob/9d41a5bbdbd3a850d4640cea31c810e35cf8f46f/common/config/workflow.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0019.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0206","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0206.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-3152","title":"Oracle Fusion Middleware Oracle Reports Developer 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Oracle Fusion Middleware 的 Oracle Reports Developer 组件中的 Report Server Component 存在未指定漏洞，远程攻击者可通过 URLPARAMETER 功能向 reports/rwservlet 发送特制请求，实现任意文件读取与上传。该漏洞影响 11.1.1.4、11.1.1.6 及 11.1.2.0 等版本，CVSS 评分 9.1，危害等级严重。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，结合 CVE-2012-3153 上传 .jsp 文件可进一步实现任意代码执行。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-2012-3152"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2012-10-16T23:55:03Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:42:40Z","remediation":"立即安装 Oracle 2012 年 10 月关键补丁更新（CPUOct2012），将 Oracle Fusion Middleware 升级至 11.1.1.7 或更高版本。如无法立即打补丁，可在 weblogic 管理控制台禁用 reports/rwservlet 的 URLPARAMETER 功能，或通过防火墙限制对 reports 服务的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blog.netinfiltration.com/2013/11/03/oracle-reports-cve-2012-3152-and-cve-2012-3153/","http://blog.netinfiltration.com/2014/01/19/upcoming-exploit-release-oracle-forms-and-reports-11g/","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2014/Jan/186","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/31253","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2013:150","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/cpuoct2012-1515893.html","http://www.osvdb.org/86394","http://www.osvdb.org/86395","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/55955","http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NinvMDOj7sM","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/79295","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2012-3152","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/31737","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-3152.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/3c5116308718006831f8b0ac674f891f3d553471/2012/CVE-2012-3152.json","https://github.com/j0bin/Pentest-Resources/blob/94995990abed3dbce8f4bb29e11127265515aa9a/Attack/cve-2012-3152.py","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/nuclei/CVE-2012-3152.yaml","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3152","https://github.com/smartFlash/pySecurity/blob/ebcd0364af1f38444411123443141ff463428b73/SUMMARY